From 6d42dcf8f0000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lukas Zeller <luz@plan44.ch>
Date: Wed, 05 Nov 2025 00:00:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] i2c: rk3x: add rv1103b support with autostop and reset

Add support for the Rockchip RV1103b I2C controller variant including:
- rv1103b compatible string and soc_data with correct GRF offset
- REG_CON1 and REG_SCL_OE_DB register definitions for version 5+ hardware
- Auto-stop mode support to reduce interrupt overhead
- Reset control for error recovery (SCL held by slave)
- Suspend/resume support with bus locking
- bus_nr fallback to adapter nr when DT alias is missing
- Dynamic transfer timeout based on message length and frequency
- Updated GRF write logic for rv1103b/rv1108/rv1126 variants

---
